TITLE:: SequencerGui_Old
SUMMARY:: Provides a GUI to visually represent sequences created using a Sequencer_Old.
CATEGORIES:: Streams-Patterns-Events
RELATED:: Classes/Sequencer_Old, Classes/SequencerGui

DESCRIPTION::
LINK::Classes/SequencerGui_Old:: is the previous version of the sequencer GUI, kept around because some existing tracks still depend on LINK::Classes/Sequencer_Old::. New work should use LINK::Classes/SequencerGui:: instead.

LINK::Classes/SequencerGui_Old:: provides a visualisation of a graph of LINK::Classes/Pattern::s created using a LINK::Classes/Sequencer_Old::. This is created when calling LINK::Classes/Sequencer_Old#-showGui::.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates an instance of LINK::Classes/SequencerGui_Old::.

ARGUMENT:: sequencer
The LINK::Classes/Sequencer_Old:: that this LINK::Classes/SequencerGui_Old:: provides a visual representation of.

ARGUMENT:: privateSequencerData
An LINK::Classes/Event:: containing private data from the LINK::Classes/Sequencer_Old:: that is needed by the LINK::Classes/SequencerGui_Old::. This must contain the following keys:

TABLE::
    ## sections || The value of TELETYPE::prSections::.
::

INSTANCEMETHODS::

PRIVATE:: init, prDisplayPattern, prDisplayPbind, prLoadParts, prLoadSections, prLoadSequences
